  42:Drivers/lvgl/src/fs/../../include/lvgl/core/../font/../draw/../stdlib/lv_string.h ****  * @brief Fills a block of memory with a specified value.
  43:Drivers/lvgl/src/fs/../../include/lvgl/core/../font/../draw/../stdlib/lv_string.h ****  * @param dst Pointer to the destination array to fill with the specified value.
  44:Drivers/lvgl/src/fs/../../include/lvgl/core/../font/../draw/../stdlib/lv_string.h ****  * @param v Value to be set. The value is passed as an int, but the function fills
  45:Drivers/lvgl/src/fs/../../include/lvgl/core/../font/../draw/../stdlib/lv_string.h ****  *          the block of memory using the unsigned char conversion of this value.
